{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f9b31b70c099d06f5fa0c467033f68f7eb5ff23f77d07b8501471deae3d7ea1", "ja": "（合同ライブの宣伝PVの撮影が進んでいる。\n今は休憩中だけど、未来はどこに行ったんだろう？）", "zh": "（联合演唱会宣传PV的拍摄正在进行中。\n现在是休息时间，未来去哪儿了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "750806bf6b9483dd118885a3f032ed59e3767b1af9d2e27dabcdb7816864f34a", "ja": "あ、いたいた！\nおーい未来、そろそろ撮影再開だって。", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了！\n喂——未来，差不多要重新开始拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "a285fb5ead46b66fdf96387e0381aa9dee8da5884756be9d1c8dce5f0f98a1b7", "ja": "あっ！？　{$P$}さん……！\nぐすっ……。", "zh": "啊！？　{$P$}先生……！\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "972fb9d458d21100ed777d4ef980ef075240c023d38ce138826433d0b4b980e1", "ja": "えっ！？　ど、どうしたんだ？\n大丈夫か！？", "zh": "诶！？怎、怎么了？\n你没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c453bffe46b6ebb5dfd315a2050913e8bb026c604f1c73a0b35b1d4c94468d2", "ja": "えっ？　あ……違います！　ぐすっ。\nこれは、どこかにぶつけたとかじゃなくて！", "zh": "咦？啊……不是的！呜……\n这不是撞到什么地方弄伤的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "b904e5e06c3b3ff3771c379c5b01194bc537d8fdddb7a63ed166979e27ef4ba1", "ja": "今日のPVって、懐かしい映像がたくさん\n流れるじゃないですか？", "zh": "今天的PV里，会播放许多令人怀念的影像，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "344f4fc5e97d7418c57c224e74de93761c43ea4556b036c78270285669d1e880", "ja": "それ見てたら、なんだか泣けてきちゃって……うーん？\n楽しい思い出ばっかりなのに、なんでなのかな～？", "zh": "看着那些画面，不知怎么就有点想哭了……嗯？\n明明全都是快乐的回忆，为什么会这样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f5cf3ee57ce17794987b908962e65d3d00eaf4472c0a8e9c0e1d76a1cb593afe", "ja": "そういうことか……よかった。\nまあ思い出っていうのは、そういうものじゃないか？", "zh": "原来是这样……太好了。\n不过，回忆不就是这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a3916c5d75e8a6fc318cd159fd95130b25aa2c59c57227833a147a26b54b5792", "ja": "そうやって、胸がいっぱいになってしまうくらい、\nいい思い出だったってことだろう。", "zh": "也就是说，是段美好的回忆，才会让人如此感慨万千吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "5badd5176b5ecbcf8fa9e3bb1201c85635cc372943455437ad7e849512cf4885", "ja": "あ、そっか。いい思い出ばっかりだったから、\n私、泣いちゃったんですね！　やったー♪", "zh": "啊，原来是这样。因为全都是美好的回忆，\n所以我才哭出来的吧！太好啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7d62ba7d750161eef9d848e5f31a995706aa2f971389b1c37a7b88f71f8831e0", "ja": "おっ、よかった。\n無事に落ち着いたみたいだな？", "zh": "哦，太好了。\n看来已经顺利平静下来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "2464bcc6ff5e1b93ea27a07cce77a244106e8e4f4266317d695ad8220afee1dd", "ja": "え……あれっ？\nほんとだ！　私、泣きやんでます！", "zh": "咦……诶？\n真的耶！我已经不哭了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "7b2e9543e9ef43cff1b94d8d57115faff540e5af76c44259f4f009542a4f899d", "ja": "{$P$}さんって、やっぱり\nすごいですね！　すごーい！　えらーい！", "zh": "{$P$}先生果然很厉害呢！好厉害——！真棒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b40de42eb7aecc04295df53fc53aeb17b734547a6ca49f4734914e59dde53c6e", "ja": "そ、そうか、ありがとう。", "zh": "是、是吗，谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "7a00be42d1cdbd64c1a8070864907cf625a60815a7bec2a3e43a0b72af9b21ac", "ja": "よーしっ、後半の撮影も頑張るぞ～。楽しい思い出、\nもっと増やさなくちゃ！　えへへ、いってきまーす！", "zh": "好～嘞，后半段的拍摄我也要加油啦～。\n得多创造些开心的回忆才行！嘿嘿，我出发啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0233_1016_p", "source_sha256": "747bf049f1741dc8a57a597eeb9c73b59763eb60e80037f5cebf86e7a8ffca21", "ja": "（今日も未来の新たな思い出が増えていく。\nこれからも、嬉しい涙だけを流してもらわないとな！）", "zh": "（今天未来又会增添新的回忆。今后也得让她流下喜悦的泪水才行啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
